  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xCJvDJk.png\" width=\"524\" height=\"138\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=condaforge&amp;logoColor=d9aa6b&amp;labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.20.x-積極開發中-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">請使用 CurseForge 下載，請勿重新託管檔案。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組可用於任何模組包（在 CurseForge 上）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;目前暫無 Fabric 版本的計劃，抱歉。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">模組介紹</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">新增 1 種新模板和 7 種新飾邊材料。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">最初是為配合 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Additional Trims</a> 使用而製作，但也可單獨使用。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">蠻族盔甲飾邊可透過擊殺豬布林蠻兵獲得（10% 掉落機率）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x7U5ZbT.png\" alt=\"烈焰\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/25uqPtQ.png\" alt=\"迴響\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KAkaSqs.png\" alt=\"終界\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dnnJDpf.png\" alt=\"羽毛\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITUVP2t.png\" alt=\"海磷石\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afLMXnH.png\" alt=\"蜘蛛\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6DyeSfT.png\" alt=\"凋零\" width=\"350\" height=\"307\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 + 版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">舊版本</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>